  "short_description": "實驗室裡為什麼會有一顆巨蛋？你的工作很簡單：把它敲開。別問為什麼。 《破殼行動 (CRACK)》是一款支援 1–4 人合作的漸進式冒險遊戲。和朋友一起想辦法打開這顆神秘巨蛋，看看裡面到底藏著什麼。",
  "short_description_en": "Why is there a giant egg in this lab? Your job is simple: crack it open. Don't ask questions. CRACK is a 1-4 player co-op incremental adventure about uncovering what's inside a mysterious giant egg.",
